{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"S1 ee8a third review: BLOCK on T8 CRITICAL — the ${...} grammar left every non-${env:} form undispositioned: whether ${run:...} is validated as a literal/skipped/deferred, and whether an unrecognized namespace or malformed placeholder is a hard error or a silent literal. Direct consequence of the previous ordering fix ('validate the resolved value' is incoherent for values that cannot be resolved yet). Remediated: closed two-namespace grammar owned by headers.py including the ${run:} key vocabulary as a module constant (no dependency on 6cd0), every malformed/unknown form a hard LLMConfigError, ${run:} left unresolved but key-checked at config time, value validation on the post-env value with placeholders intact and re-run after ${run:} substitution in 26ae. Added 2 ACs and grammar-disposition tests."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787707732192686001,"uuid":"7fa8b2c9-9d48-41eb-9e87-0ec5f8e1cddd"}